OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed schoolboy and
OL,4,Afled UK left 'trail of destruction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeaton Slater, 12, was killed in a
OL,7,Fhit-and-run as he walked home from
OL,8,Fschool in June 2024
OL,10,FDriver Aleksanders Dolars fled to
OL,11,FLatvia afterwards and was only
OL,12,Fextradited back to UK in August this
OL,13,Fyear
OL,15,FThe 23-year-old Latvian admitted
OL,16,Fcausing death by dangerous driving, and
OL,17,Fhad been clocked at 70mph in a 30mph
OL,18,Fzone, with footage played in court
OL,20,FDolars did not want to attend his
OL,21,Fsentencing hearing, but the judge
OL,22,Fdemanded he be brought to court
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
