OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed schoolboy and
OL,4,Afled UK left 'trail of destruction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeaton's older brother Kai told the
OL,7,Fsentencing hearing that his death had
OL,8,Fleft a space in his heart "that can
OL,9,Fnever be killed"
OL,11,FHis name has been known publicly as
OL,12,FDolars Aleksanders, but the court has
OL,13,Fconfirmed Latvian officials say it is
OL,14,FAleksanders Dolars
